{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890430/extras/fc8277d313127ec930b33db4a3e497b8.avif?t=1755305642\" width=800 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RAVENHOLLOW CHRONICLES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hentai game with turn-based battles and a visual novel where you play as a scientist who arrives at an isolated village called Ravenhollow with the intention of writing your doctoral thesis on anomalous phenomena and mythological creatures. Your goal is to scientifically observe the strange inhabitants of the area: vampires, shapeshifters, werewolf girls, and other entities that seem to come from a dark dream. Upon arrival, you meet a mysterious young woman named Viernes13, who seems to know too much about the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viernes13 tells you about the Heart of Lugrenwald, a forest that no one has crossed and returned sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this intriguing story as you meet the village girls, win their hearts through dates and gifts, and have sex with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Warning! This game contains explicit sex, sexual acts, inappropriate language, violent behavior, voyeurism, and satanic references. All characters depicted are adults, and none of these characters or scenes are real; they are parodic interpretations created for humorous, entertainment, and artistic purposes. We do not seek to glorify or promote the behaviors depicted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890430/extras/fea2ff394f74c21654065f9cd18b09c4.avif?t=1755305642\" width=1600 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha